B.Iq=new A.cA("Bacterial Spot","Xanthomonas campestris pv. vesicatoria","Bacterial spot causes dark, water-soaked circular lesions on tomato leaves and scab-like spots on developing fruit. It spreads extremely rapidly in warm, rainy conditions via splash vectors.",B.NK,B.LX,B.PO,B.O2,B.Qf,"Approximately 2 to 4 weeks with early treatment.","Inspect inner leaves weekly during wet spells. Pruning branches within 12 inches of the ground prevents splash inoculations.",null)
